  "body": "https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.1#conditions says: \r\n> `key` The dot-separated field of the event to match, e.g. `content.body`\r\n\r\nVarious standard event fields (notably those in https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/1849) have dots in their names. It's unclear how these are handled.",
